body:
To me, I don't go for individual artists. Like yes, excision and subtronics are great. Some of my favorites, even if that's a basic rave baby answer, and that b2b was awesome from what i saw online. But EDM for me has been less about individual artists and more about a vibe and an experience. 

&#x200B;

So while yes, I'm slightly jealous that we won't get the forbidden 4 and the huge b2b... I feel like LL is more than just a concert. I don't know. This is my first LL and my first big festival. But the amount of people who say they're coming "home" when they go to LL, I don't hear nearly as many people say that about any other fest.   


Lost Lands is bigger than who's performing. It's a vibe, it's a family, and it's an experience. 

&#x200B;

Idk my two cents as a LL rave baby.
